Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value STATUS (Enabled|Disabled|\S+)
Value LINK (Up|Down|\S+)
Value SPEED (\S+)
Value DUPLEX (\S+)
Value VSL (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value PVID (\d+)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*)

Start
  ^\s*Interface\s+Status\s+Link\s+ActSpeed\s+ActDuplex
  ^-+
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${LINK}\s+${SPEED}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${TYPE}\s+${PVID}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${LINK}\s+${SPEED}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${TYPE}\s+${PVID}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${LINK}\s+${SPEED}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${VSL}\s+${TYPE}\s+${PVID}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${STATUS}\s+${LINK}\s+${SPEED}\s+${DUPLEX}\s+${VSL}\s+${TYPE}\s+${PVID}\s*$$ -> Record
